        "heading": "Facebook Ads That Convert for Shopify Stores",
        "sub_heading": "Turn Scrollers Into Shoppers—Fast.",
        "text": "<p>If you’re running a Shopify store and not tapping into Facebook Ads properly, you’re leaving money on the table. We build campaigns that stop the scroll, spark interest, and push people to purchase. From retargeting abandoned carts to setting up winning cold campaigns—we don’t guess, we test, track and scale.</p><p>Whether you're pushing limited-edition drops, evergreen bestsellers, or seasonal promos, we know how to get your product in front of the right eyes—without wasting budget on window shoppers. Our creatives are built for conversions, our audiences are dialled in, and we monitor performance daily.</p><p>Let’s turn that product feed into real sales.</p><p></p>",
