        "heading": "An Agency That Actually Gets Facebook Ads",
        "sub_heading": "Not all ad agencies are built the same. Here’s what makes us different.",
        "text": "<p>We’re not here to blow smoke. We’ve run Facebook Ads across hundreds of campaigns—for Shopify brands scaling to six-figures and local service businesses who just want their phones buzzing again.</p><p>We test like mad scientists, track performance religiously, and adjust fast. We know how to read the data, understand the customer journey, and find the ad angles that actually get people to act. Whether it's clicks, checkouts, or calendar bookings—we get how Facebook works, and we know how to make it work for <em>you</em>.</p><p>You won’t find bloated retainers or cookie-cutter campaigns here. Just real people doing smart work with sharp thinking. That’s our edge.</p>",
        "button_link": "#",
        "button_text": "Help Grow My Business",
        "image_right": false,
        "text_align": "left",
        "background_color": "#ffffff",
        "desktop_padding_top": 60,
