        "text": "<p><strong>Experience, local insight, and no wasted budget.</strong></p><p>You’ve probably run a few ads before—boosted a post here, tried a ‘set and forget’ campaign there. But let’s be real: Facebook Ads can either blow up your sales or blow your budget. We’ve spent years fine-tuning campaigns that actually work for both eCommerce brands and trades-based businesses.</p><p>We know how to read the data, tweak the targeting, and craft ad creative that speaks directly to your audience. No guesswork. No generic strategies. Just proper, high-performance campaigns designed to bring in results.</p>",
        "trust_image": "shopify://shop_images/Artboard_13.png",
        "desktop_padding_top": 60,
        "desktop_padding_bottom": 60,
        "mobile_padding_top": 40,
        "mobile_padding_bottom": 40
      }
